{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_008_01_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f8f92b5554a9eac7931f4929216f9ed71cd4ed41d0811c4d1c2426d8333376d0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1420986b93300398bca5457efa57a0cc6e21ba771682888175c2cd7089c1280d",
      "text": "这样啊！\n我们正好在招募主唱，真是帮大忙了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfd7c6be896e5df74e9ec8329b2e0aec2745bfb865b40714cf62a464bc45d5dd",
      "text": "我在卡拉OK可是能随心所欲地打出想要的分数，\n尽情期待吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_g:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f111ea7fa89f2320c2def5ad3543dafd3831f58bdc75e1535c4820f412e3f8d3",
      "text": "能操纵分数……好厉害……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_g:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc7137985d4c9d0340029c98d2260f7d44925d8ee0305fde1d9f00b546d63d6c",
      "text": "嘿嘿♪旬亲的键盘，\n还有夏来亲的贝斯也都太棒了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_g:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69f48b342deeeeb69d7182eb5ade56ca4dd34acb1c592520ea7713ba082b7e32",
      "text": "“旬亲”……？\n那是什么称呼啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_g:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f492fdaa9da0b5c3c4d3fce0ea21fa2724e1f256d8e74b36bff84287c7aa129",
      "text": "是绰号啦！因为\n我们不是接下来要一起共事的同伴嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_g:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aee1103d8b4e9be0bd0537a6ccf9bbbfb17b3b925a153702308b3f67e49287ff",
      "text": "……！\n我觉得挺好的，这种感觉！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_g:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a14a3a1a72a6bbbf97abb5ecc1b46b929c11327743c6a03c24ae43347847a4bd",
      "text": "该怎么说呢，我开始搞乐队的理由……\n嘛、虽然也是想受女孩子欢迎啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_g:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:994f73b393ac33f75614551b8669acdcdeea8f62e5be0cfe99f55ff4c67a764e",
      "text": "另一个理由就是，想做很有青春感的事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_g:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf972ad45987ec204dc9598095ce59511905fddb052367a84cd06cc8d4b25260",
      "text": "伙伴、友情、羁绊之类的。\n想要体验一下那种感觉！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
